even if that necessitates a secondary stop beyond the stop line or crosswalk.</span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'> 
(Ord. 18743 </span><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
